 # Current Status
 
-Last updated: 2026-07-13.
+Last updated: 2026-08-12.
+
+## Publication-readiness work (2026-08-12)
+
+Three gaps blocking a Q1 neuroimaging submission were addressed. None of them
+retunes the frozen cohort and no frozen decoder value changed.
+
+| Gap | State | Record |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| No conventional MVPA comparator | **Closed.** Linear SVM `0.8051`, logistic `0.8028`, correlation centroid `0.6963` under the identical 30-fold nested protocol. Frozen decoder leads the SVM by `+0.0262`, CI95 `[+0.0107, +0.0426]`, winning 40 of 62 subjects. | [Standard MVPA Baseline](STANDARD_MVPA_BASELINE.md) |
+| Broken neural negative control | **Diagnosed and fixed; old claim withdrawn and reversed.** Three compounding causes: BatchNorm running statistics (between-sample signal decays to `0.000224` by layer4 in eval mode), uncentered inputs (discriminative variation only ~1.4% of total), and global average pooling, which is translation-invariant while somatotopic class identity *is* spatial position. A location-preserving CNN trains in one epoch and reaches `0.7936` independent / `0.8636` balanced on a held-out fold, competitive with the linear SVM's `0.8030`/`0.8750` on that fold. | [Neural Lane Gate](NEURAL_LANE_GATE.md) |
+| No inter-subject normalization | **Scoped, not closed.** The release ships no MNI BOLD and no anatomical transforms, and ciftify carries only level-2 GLM dtseries. The viable route projects existing `space-T1w` BOLD onto the shipped `native/` surfaces and MSMSulc spheres with Connectome Workbench. | [Inter-Subject Normalization](INTER_SUBJECT_NORMALIZATION.md) |
+
+The most consequential new finding is the centering ablation, now complete across
+all 30 folds. Removing the unlabeled subject-run centering drops independent
+accuracy from `0.8051` to `0.2860` (linear SVM) and `0.8028` to `0.2883`
+(logistic), against a `0.25` chance level, with tight subject-bootstrap intervals.
+That `-0.52` effect is roughly **twenty times** the frozen hierarchy's `+0.026`
+advantage over standard linear MVPA, and the same step is what makes the neural
+lane trainable at all.
+
+The honest ordering of contributions is therefore **centering first**,
+leakage-aware evaluation second, the covariance hierarchy third. The manuscript
+currently implies the reverse.
+
+Required framing changes are recorded in the Headline Rule and Required
+Limitations sections of the [Publication Plan](PUBLICATION_PLAN.md).
+
+## Historical record (frozen 2026-07-13)
 
 This repository records the completed full-dataset investigation and frozen confirmation state for 4-class motor-task fMRI classification. The unpublished manuscript and private paper PDFs are intentionally not part of this public repo.
 
